       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "Fixed as part of task 146232. Methods ingestObject(), exportObject(), and describeUser() were all removed from API-M. The Management interface was updated to remove adminPing(), introduce ingest() and export() methods, and deprecate ingestObject() and exportObject() methods.",
