  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "ingestObject was supposedly deprecated since 2.2 (perhaps earlier, but I don't recall) in favor of ingest.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "If it's going to be dropped, dropping it for 3.0b2 or final seems appropriate.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Also, the Management interface still defines adminPing, which doesn't exist in the API-M WSDL. This seems like another candidate for removal unless there's a reason for the inconsistency.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
