  "description": "<p>ingestObject was supposedly deprecated since 2.2 (perhaps earlier, but I don't recall) in favor of ingest.</p>\n\n<p>If it's going to be dropped, dropping it for 3.0b2 or final seems appropriate.</p>\n\n<p>Also, the Management interface still defines adminPing, which doesn't exist in the API-M WSDL. This seems like another candidate for removal unless there's a reason for the inconsistency.</p>",
